<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ADE Corp raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ADE Corp raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex Brown said it raised its rating on ADE Corp to buy from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- ADE Corp gained 7/8 to 17-1/4 in morning trading.</p>
<p>(( -- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
